  - {fileID: 834751859832392973}
  TutorialSteps:
  - text: "Ch\xE0o m\u1EEBng b\u1EA1n \u0111\u1EBFn v\u1EDBi B70 - 1 d\u1EF1 \xE1n
      nho nh\u1ECF c\u1EE7a t\u1EE5i m\xECnh ^v^"
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4b59c03a57461dc458da74f0e355db19, type: 3}
  - text: "M\xECnh l\xE0 Giang, l\xE0 ng\u01B0\u1EDDi s\u1EBD \u0111\u1ED3ng h\xE0nh
      c\xF9ng b\u1EA1n trong chuy\u1EBFn \u0111i n\xE0y."
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 829ce076cb87c30419e16865bffff283, type: 3}
  - text: "C\xF9ng nhau, ch\xFAng ta s\u1EBD t\xE1i hi\u1EC7n l\u1EA1i \u0110\u1EA1i
      h\u1ECDc B\xE1ch Khoa H\xE0 N\u1ED9i..."
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6b889fc05a10c1741a361fa9e3466537, type: 3}
  - text: "Gi\u1EDD th\xEC b\u1EAFt \u0111\u1EA7u th\xF4i \u2014 h\xE3y x\xE2y d\u1EF1ng
      c\xF4ng tr\xECnh \u0111\u1EA7u ti\xEAn nh\xE9!"
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 906e1beca630e574babc9af98912997e, type: 3}
